 at Kandivali West. 6 min to Kandivali Station, 10 min to Western Express Highway. Link Road – 2 Mins, S. V. Road – 5 Mins, Dahanukar Wadi Metro Station – 2 Mins. It offers Luxurious 2 & 3 BHK Balcony Apartments. 20+ State-Of-The-Art Amenities. Connected to all Major Hubs. Terrace Amenities – Infinity Swimming pool, Pool Deck, Gazebo, Open Cafeteria, BBQ, Meditation Corner with Pergolas, Senior Citizen Area, Kids Play Area, Rock Climbing Wall. Other Amenities – Gymnasium, Spa & Sauna, Jacuzzi, Art Display Area, Workstation / Wi-Fi Zone, Indoor Games. RERA approved project.\n\n₹\n\n## Price vs Locality\n\n₹24,161\n\n/sqft · locality avg **₹37,500**\n\n36% below avg\n\n₹\n\n## Kandivali West — resale, rent & yield\n\nResale\n\n₹25,373/sqft\n\nmedian · 34 listings\n\nRent\n\n₹75.8/sqft/mo\n\n2 BHK ~₹60,000/mo\n\nGross yield\n\n3.6%/yr\n\nrent vs resale value\n\nThis project is quoted around **₹24,161/sqft** — **5% below** resale here.\n\nFrom MPE live listings, last 18 months · [Mumbai price index ›](/mumbai-property-price-index)\n\n01\n\n## Possession Timeline\n\nProposed\n\nDec 2026\n\nStatus\n\nNew\n\n02\n\n## Unit Configurations (per MahaRERA)\n\nConfigurationCarpetIndicative Price\n\n1 RK292 ft²₹71 L\n\n1 BHK436–456 ft²₹1.05 Cr–₹1.1 Cr\n\n2 BHK565–745 ft²₹1.37 Cr–₹1.8 Cr\n\n3 BHK871–998 ft²₹2.1 Cr–₹2.41 Cr\n\nConfigurations & carpet per MahaRERA filing · indicative price = locality rate × carpet (not the developer's quote).\n\n[💬 Verify current inventory with an advisor](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=I%20am%20looking%20to%20buy%20a%20home%20in%20Project%20Rock%20Highland%20(RERA%20P51800049632))\n\n03\n\n## RERA Trust Record\n\nMahaRERA No.\n\nP51800049632\n\nRegistered\n\n2023-02-22\n\nLitigation\n\nNo reported in source\n\nEscrow Bank\n\nIDBI BANK\n\nArchitect\n\nZeeshan Khan\n\nTotal FSI\n\n16000\n\n04\n\n## Buildings · 1 Wing(s)\n\nBuilding No 31 floors · — units\n\n05\n\n## Land DNA · Genesis\n\n**Redevelopment / SRA / MHADA / MMRDA / Freehold** — provenanc