922/gis-maps-to-be-attached-to-sale-deeds-from-october-in-maharashtra)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/propertyview_rock-highland-kandivali-west_8160.html","title":"Rock Highland Kandivali West Mumbai - Price, Location, Possession, Reviews, Investor Flats, Resale Flats | PropertyCrow.com","raw_content":"![PropertyCrow.com](/propertycrow-logo-sm.svg)\n\n1. [New Projects](https://www.propertycrow.com/)\n›2. [New Projects in Mumbai](https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/property_residential-projects_1_1_0_0_0.html)\n›3. [New Projects in Kandivali West](https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/property_new-projects-in-kandivali-west_1_1_0_0_90.html)\n›4. [Rock Highland](https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/propertyview_rock-highland-kandivali-west_8160.html)\n\n![Rock Highland](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/8160/photo-36410.jpeg)\n\n![Rock Highland](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/8160/photo-36410.jpeg)\n\n![Rock Highland - Living Area](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/8160/photo-36411.jpeg)\n\n![Rock Highland - Dining Table](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/8160/photo-36412.jpeg)\n\n![Rock Highland - Bedroom](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/8160/photo-36413.jpeg)\n\n![Rock Highland - Washroom](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/8160/photo-36414.jpeg)\n\n![Rock Highland](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/8160/photo-36415.jpeg)\n\n![Rock Highland](https://www.propertycrow.com/photos/8160/photo-36415.jpeg)\n\nby Origin Corp\n\n# Rock Highland\n\nUpper Mahavir Nagar, Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\nConfig: 2 BHK & 3 BHK Flats\n\nSize Carpet Area : 565 Sq.ft - 950 Sq.ft.\n\nPrice ₹1.40 Cr Onwards\n\n**Code:** PropertyCrow8160\n\nPossession Status Under Construction - Possession Around December 2026\n\nRERA P51800049632  \n[View RERA QR Code](#qr)\n\nUnits Available Investor / Resale Units Available\n\nAbout Project\n\n## ROCK HIGHLAND\n\nNestled in the vibrant heart of Kandivali West, Rock Highland by Origin Corp stands as a testament to refined urban living. This architectural landmark elevates the standard of residential sophistication in Upper Mahavir Nagar, offering a sanctuary for those who seek a blend of tranquility and city pulse. Every corner of this development refle\n\ncts a commitment to quality craftsmanship and thoughtful design, ensuring that your home is not just a structure, but a legacy of comfort and style.  \n  \nLiving here means embracing a lifestyle where convenience is woven into the very fabric of your daily routine. The project is meticulously planned to cater to the modern family, focusing on spatial harmony and an atmosphere of openness. From the moment you step into the premises, the sense of arrival is palpable, greeted by an environment that balances contemporary aesthetics with functional elegance. It is a space where memories are curated and every sunset feels like a private viewing from your own personal haven.  \n  \nThe suite of facilities provided ensures that every necessity is met with ease and efficiency. Residents can enjoy the luxury of seamless connectivity and essential services that run like clockwork, allowing more time for what truly matters. The inclusion of lush greenery and curated open spaces offers a much-needed respite from the urban bustle, creating a pocket of serenity within the city. Whether it is the peace of mind provided by advanced safety measures or the simple joy of a well-maintained community space, the experience is designed to be holistic and fulfilling.  \n  \nChoosing this residence is an investment in a lifestyle that prioritizes well-being and community. The surrounding neighborhood complements the project’s excellence, offering a rich tapestry of social infrastructure and cultural vibrancy. It is more than just a home; it is a statement of success and a commitment to a higher standard of living. Here, the vision of a perfect urban retreat becomes a reality, crafted by a developer known for integrity and excellence in the Mumbai skyline.\n\n2 BHK Flats with Balcony  \nCarpet Area: 565 Sq.ft, 665 Sq.ft, 745 Sq.ft  \n  \n3 BHK Flats with Balcony  \nCarpet Area: 871 Sq.ft, 950 Sq.ft  \n  \nBuilding Details:  \n0.46 Acres Land / 1 Tower / 38 Residential Floors / 199 Units\n\nAmenities\n\n## Project Amenities\n\nLift Water Storage   \nLandscaped Garden  \nFire Fighting Systems  \nCar Parking  \nFeng Shui / Vaastu  \n24X7 Water Supply  \nWaste Disposal  \nVisitor Parking Facility  \nSociety Office\n\nFloor Plans\n\n## Floor Plan\n\n![2 BHK Floor Plan](/floor-plan.jpg)\n\n🔒 Submit enquiry to unlock floor plan\n\nLocation\n\n## Location & Nearby\n\nMap - Upper Mahavir Nagar, Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n**Address:** Upper Mahavir Nagar, Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n**Close To:** Link Road, S.V. Road, Mahatma Gandhi Road, Western Express Highway, Akurli Road\n\n#### Schools\n\nVibgyor High School Kandivali, Oxford Public School Kandivali, St. Lawrence High School\n\n#### Hospitals\n\nZenith Hospital, Namaha Hospital, Dr. Netra Palta Hospital\n\n#### Restaurants\n\nPop Tate€™s, Joey€™s Pizza, Urban Tadka\n\n#### Bank/ATMs\n\nHDFC Bank, ICICI Bank, State Bank of India\n\n#### Bus Stop\n\nMahavir Nagar Bus Stop, Kandarpada Bus Stop, Boraspada Bus Stop\n\n#### Metro/Railway\n\nKandivali Railway Station, Malad Railway Station, Lower Juhu Metro Station\n\n#### Airport\n\nChhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport, Mumbai Domestic Airport, Juhu Aerodrome\n\n#### Petrol Pumps\n\nHP Petrol Pump Mahavir Nagar, Bharat Petroleum Kandivali, Indian Oil Borivali\n\n#### Shopping Mall\n\nGrowel€™s 101 Mall, Infiniti Mall Malad, Raghuleela Mega Mall\n\n#### Parks\n\nEvershine Nagar Garden, Veer Savarkar Udyan, BMC Garden Kandivali\n\n#### Place of Worship\n\nMahavir Jain Temple, St. Blaise Church, Ganesh Mandir Kandivali\n\n#### Groceries\n\nD Mart Kandivali, Reliance Smart, Nature€™s Basket\n\n#### Movie Theaters\n\nPVR Milap Kandivali, Inox Malad, Cinemax Goregaon\n\n#### Police Station\n\nKandivali Police Station,